[node name="Label" type="Label" parent="Instructions" unique_id=168596400]
offset_left = 30.0
offset_top = 25.0
text = "SHEATHED RUN — procedural motion + AnimationPlayer edits
Editor: select Controls/AnimationPlayer, choose run_sheathed, and scrub.
Select a bone, move/rotate it, and key its transform. Neutral bones reproduce the original motion.
F6 plays the loop. See RUN-ANIMATION-EDITING.md for controls and examples."
